      "message": "No better suggestions here, but these swizzles are a bummer.\n\nReminds me of a suggestion bsalomon@ had a while back (when Runtime Blender was being designed) about how we should eventually aim to allow any signature, but obviously that\u0027s its own nontrivial project.",
